        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia L.COLDB, Omnia Level Smart Lock Deadbolt </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia Level Smart Lock Deadbolt was designed with security and style in mind. This is a Smart lock, although you may not be able to tell from the outside. The OMNIA+ Level product line has all the smart front door lock technology hidden inside the door. Since it is powered by a CR2 battery, there is no hardwiring. The Smart Lock Deadbolt is easy to install on most pre-drilled doors. The Level Bolt App allows you to control your lock from anywhere. Lock, unlock, share access, see who comes and goes, and more using your app from almost anywhere. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Level Bolt App Features:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lock and unlock using your phone.</li>\r\n<li>Auto-Lock and Auto-Unlock.</li>\r\n<li>Show Activity.</li>\r\n<li>App is available for iOS and Android.</li>\r\n<li>Create and manage keyless access.</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with Amazon Alexa, Ring, and Apple HomeKit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Level Smart Lock Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI Grade 1</li>\r\n<li>Backup Mechanical Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Power: 1 CR2 Lithium 3 Volt Battery</li>\r\n<li>Audio: Multi Tone Chimes</li>\r\n<li>Wireless: Bluetooth Low Energy</li>\r\n<li>iOS or Android Device Required</li>\r\n<li>Operating Temperature: -4 to 140 Degrees F</li>\r\n<li>Weather Resistance to IPX4 Standards</li>\r\n<li>Remote Connectivity: Apple HomeKit and Amazon Sidewalk</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Omnia Level Smart Lock Deadbolt, Omnia L.COLDB",
